sequenceDiagram
    participant Employee
    participant Backend
    participant DB
    participant Vendor
    participant Accounts

    Employee->>Backend: Submit PR
    Backend->>DB: Save PR
    Employee->>Backend: Approve PR
    Backend->>DB: Update PR
    Backend->>Vendor: Send RFQ
    Vendor->>Backend: Submit Quotations
    Backend->>DB: Save Quotes
    Employee->>Backend: Select Vendor
    Backend->>DB: Generate PO
    Backend->>Vendor: Send PO Alert
    Vendor->>Backend: Fulfill PO
    Employee->>Backend: Create Goods Receipt
    Backend->>DB: Update Inventory
    Vendor->>Backend: Submit Invoice
    Backend->>DB: 3-Way Match Validation
    DB-->>Backend: Result Verified
    Backend->>Accounts: Flag for Payment
